---
title: "Oghenemaro Okolosio — Senior Software Engineer"
description: "Oghenemaro Okolosio is a senior software engineer in Lagos with over six years building payments, lending and data platforms in TypeScript, React, Node.js and .NET."
layout: layouts/main.njk
---

<section class="section intro">
  <img src="/assets/images/maro-192.jpg" alt="Portrait of Oghenemaro Okolosio" class="portrait" width="48" height="48" />
  <h1>{{ cv.name }}</h1>
  <p class="role">{{ cv.role }}</p>

  <p>
    Over six years ago I started writing code for banks, and most of it ended up
    in front of someone: a merchant at checkout, a customer halfway through
    KYC, a parent watching a bus move on a map.
  </p>
  <p>
    I build backends and the interfaces on top of them — TypeScript, React and
    Next.js, with Node or .NET behind. Today I lead engineering on Alero at
    <a href="https://www.unionbankng.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Union Bank of Nigeria</a>.
  </p>
  <p class="meta" style="margin-top: 21.6px">{{ cv.location }} · {{ cv.availability }}</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2 class="label">Experience</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    {% for job in cv.experience %}
      <li class="row">
        <span class="aside">{{ job.period }}</span>
        <div>
          <p class="title">{{ job.role }}, {{ job.company }}</p>
          <p class="desc">{{ job.summary }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p class="more"><a href="/about/">Full experience and skills</a></p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2 class="label">Selected work</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    {% for item in cv.work %}
      <li class="row">
        <span class="aside">
          {% if item.url %}
            <a href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ext">{{ item.name }}</a>
          {% else %}
            <span class="title">{{ item.name }}</span>
          {% endif %}
        </span>
        <p>{{ item.description }}</p>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2 class="label">Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Happy to talk about engineering roles, a project, or anything on this
    page. The fastest way to reach me is
    <a href="mailto:omarookolosio94@gmail.com">email</a>, or
    <a href="https://calendar.app.google/DdpEDtJUyqwCBk6M7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">book a call</a>.
  </p>
</section>
